<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">SPEECH / LANGUAGE PATHOLOGIST QUESTIONNAIRE</h2>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Child's Name:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="child_name_slp">{{ child_name_slp }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 0.5;">
      <label class="form-label">Age:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="child_age_slp">{{ child_age_slp }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 0.5;">
      <label class="form-label">DOB:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="child_dob_slp">{{ child_dob_slp }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>I hereby authorize <span data-field="teacher_name_slp">{{ teacher_name_slp }}</span>, Teacher's Name to release information regarding my child to the <span data-field="school_name_slp">{{ school_name_slp }}</span>.</p>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <p>Parent Signature</p>
      <div class="full-width-line" style="height: 1px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Relationship to child</p>
      <div class="full-width-line" style="height: 1px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <div class="full-width-line" style="height: 1px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>The above-named student has been referred to this Center for a diagnostic evaluation. It would be helpful to us if you would complete the following questionnaire and return it to the parent as soon as possible. Please feel free to include any additional information about this student that may be helpful to us in the evaluation.</p>

  <p>***Please attach the most recent therapy report and IEP and list the child's most recent academic tests.***</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Therapist's Name:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="therapist_name">{{ therapist_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">School or Clinic name:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="clinic_name">{{ clinic_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Address:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 2;"><span data-field="clinic_address">{{ clinic_address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">City:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="clinic_city">{{ clinic_city }}</span></div>
      <label class="form-label">Zip:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="clinic_zip">{{ clinic_zip }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Therapist's phone number:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="therapist_phone">{{ therapist_phone }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">How long has this child been in speech or language therapy with you?</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 2;"><span data-field="therapy_duration">{{ therapy_duration }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Therapy Schedule:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="therapy_schedule">{{ therapy_schedule }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Length of sessions:</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="session_length">{{ session_length }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Individual or Group</label>
      <div class="form-input-area" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="session_type">{{ session_type }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>If you only work within the classroom, please describe the setting and your degree of contact:</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="classroom_setting_description">{{ classroom_setting_description }}</span></div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div>
      <label class="form-label">Does the child present significant attention or behavior problems in therapy?</label>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="behavior_problems_yes" value="{{ behavior_problems_yes }}"> yes</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="behavior_problems_no" value="{{ behavior_problems_no }}"> no</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>If yes, describe the behavior and any types of cues, discipline or rewards that are effective:</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="behavior_description">{{ behavior_description }}</span></div>

  <p>What are your areas of emphasis in therapy?</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="therapy_emphasis">{{ therapy_emphasis }}</span></div>

  <p>How is the child progressing?</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="child_progress">{{ child_progress }}</span></div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div>
