<div class="page">
  <p>Please share your observations of child's social use of language with peers and / or adults (pragmatics):</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 100px;"><span data-field="pragmatics_observations">{{ pragmatics_observations }}</span></div>

  <p>What is the child's native language?</p>
  <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="native_language">{{ native_language }}</span></div>

  <p>If other than English, describe what you know about the child's use/understanding of the native language:</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="other_language_description">{{ other_language_description }}</span></div>

