  {% endfor %}

  <p>Have any non-speech/augmentative communication systems been used with the child?</p>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="has_acs_yes" value="{{ has_acs_yes }}"> yes</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="has_acs_no" value="{{ has_acs_no }}"> no</label>
  </div>

  <p>If yes, what has been tried and with what results?</p>
  <div class="form-input-area" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="acs_results">{{ acs_results }}</span></div>

  <p style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px;">Thank you for your time!</p>
</div>
